                # the body saw 0 for the WHOLE loop, silently -- `t is t + i`
                # summed zeros, rc 0, no diagnostic -- and the corruption is
                # NON-LOCAL, because any module assignment to the same name
                # anywhere in the file (before the loop, after it, or inside
                # the loop's own body) is what declines the unbox.
